# Skills And Documentation Routing

- Treat `.cursor/skills/` as the home for repo-managed skills.
- Keep skills grouped by domain under `.cursor/skills/<domain>/<skill-name>/SKILL.md`.
- Keep the index in `.cursor/skills/skills.index.json` aligned with every skill add/remove.
- Use `AGENTS.md` for repository map and `Documentation/README.md` for canonical docs navigation.
- Use `docs/CURSOR-AGENT-HANDBOOK.md` for workflow and CI agent operating guidance.
- For implementation runbooks and onboarding, place new guides in `docs/guides/`.
- If workflow behavior, readiness, or dependencies change, update relevant entries in `Documentation/feature-tracker.md` and `Documentation/decision-log.md`.
